WEBVTT

01:45.040 --> 01:49.960
<b>Weak and Strong</b>

01:55.210 --> 01:56.590
Brother!

01:56.590 --> 02:00.090
He had potential, but he was merely human.

02:00.090 --> 02:01.940
They break so easily.

02:02.650 --> 02:03.970
Move, damn it!

02:03.970 --> 02:08.230
You're in the way! Brother! Brother!

02:03.970 --> 02:08.230
I should return him to the hole 
while he's still alive.

02:08.230 --> 02:11.010
After all, I'm capable of reason.

02:11.010 --> 02:11.950
Brother!

02:16.320 --> 02:18.900
Why'd you let your guard down, monster?

02:19.340 --> 02:20.380
Toma.

02:20.910 --> 02:23.360
What are you doing over here?

02:23.360 --> 02:25.660
I told you to handle all the nobodies.

02:26.480 --> 02:29.160
Right. Sorry, Brother.

02:29.160 --> 02:31.240
<i>His throat regenerated.</i>

02:31.240 --> 02:32.280
<i>How?</i>

02:32.280 --> 02:34.990
<i>He should be an ordinary human.</i>

02:34.990 --> 02:35.920
<i>No...</i>

02:36.170 --> 02:39.490
<i>While he was in the hole, 
did he merge with them?</i>

02:40.000 --> 02:41.100
Hey, monster.

02:41.100 --> 02:45.310
What's that strange vibe 
I sensed coming from you earlier?

02:45.310 --> 02:46.830
Is he talking about tao?

02:46.830 --> 02:49.770
Ordinary humans shouldn't 
be able to detect it.

02:49.770 --> 02:52.820
Hey, you quit your stupid yapping.

02:52.820 --> 02:57.030
Could it be that that's the monster's power?

02:58.410 --> 03:01.550
Is that the key to killing the Tensen?

03:01.550 --> 03:06.160
This man's tao is larger than before.

03:06.910 --> 03:08.050
I can feel it.

03:08.050 --> 03:10.010
This man is dangerous.

03:10.010 --> 03:11.760
I should kill him now.

03:14.100 --> 03:15.420
I can't see it.

03:17.550 --> 03:19.760
<i>He's so small, but so strong.</i>

03:19.760 --> 03:22.430
<i>Is what I sensed his secret?</i>

03:30.230 --> 03:32.810
<i>His tao is continuing to grow.</i>

03:32.810 --> 03:34.320
<i>Is it the vines' influence?</i>

03:34.320 --> 03:36.650
<i>He's exceeded human capabilities.</i>

03:36.650 --> 03:39.150
<i>My brother is a master of adaptation.</i>

03:39.150 --> 03:42.120
<i>But at this rate...</i>

03:42.530 --> 03:43.800
<i>If he keeps going...</i>

03:44.720 --> 03:46.930
I'm not sure what's happening,

03:46.930 --> 03:49.910
but my body's become awfully convenient.

03:49.910 --> 03:51.640
You're quite courageous.

03:51.640 --> 03:55.670
Do you not fear your body changing 
and no longer being human?

03:55.990 --> 03:57.190
Nah.

03:57.630 --> 04:00.170
Nothing in this world is static.

04:00.170 --> 04:01.670
I know that well.

04:01.670 --> 04:05.430
There's only one thing 
that doesn't need to change.

04:05.430 --> 04:08.180
One? You mean your sense of self?

04:08.940 --> 04:10.680
No.

04:11.460 --> 04:12.560
<i>What are you doing?</i>

04:12.560 --> 04:13.190
<i>Brother...</i>

04:13.190 --> 04:16.400
Your privileged upbringing 
is written all over your face.

04:16.400 --> 04:20.290
You're so classy, it makes
 people disrespect us.

04:20.290 --> 04:23.160
I'll turn you two into real bandits.

04:23.540 --> 04:26.280
Let's start with the younger one.

04:32.340 --> 04:34.040
Are you out of your mind?

04:34.040 --> 04:35.080
What are you doing?

04:35.880 --> 04:38.170
You still think we're classy?

04:38.170 --> 04:41.420
Anyone who's still got a problem 
with it can add more.

04:42.200 --> 04:44.590
A monster wouldn't understand.

04:45.250 --> 04:47.340
Nobody understands.

04:48.690 --> 04:52.560
Show me more of your ability.

04:57.400 --> 05:01.160
You—no, it's all of you.

05:01.160 --> 05:03.800
Your navel is your weakness after all.

05:05.610 --> 05:07.790
It keeps getting bigger.

05:07.790 --> 05:10.120
What is this man?

05:16.080 --> 05:17.670
I'm starting to see it.

05:17.670 --> 05:20.540
I knew you were emanating something,

05:20.540 --> 05:23.420
but you've got it wrapped 
all around your body.

05:23.420 --> 05:25.300
Soshin, to me—

05:25.300 --> 05:27.550
They can't.

05:28.530 --> 05:30.930
I killed them all.

05:33.470 --> 05:34.740
Come on.

05:34.740 --> 05:39.440
Show me more of your ability. Your secret!

05:43.240 --> 05:46.090
I see. So that's how you gather it.

05:46.840 --> 05:50.560
Does simply shrouding yourself 
in it not affect your defense?

05:50.560 --> 05:52.490
It breaks so easily.

05:52.490 --> 05:53.410
Impossible.

05:54.000 --> 05:57.670
My attacks were practically 
ineffective against the other one.

05:57.670 --> 05:59.820
Is it because I didn't wrap myself in it?

05:59.820 --> 06:00.900
Impossible.

06:00.900 --> 06:06.170
Seems like there's more to it, 
but I'll just have to practice.

06:06.690 --> 06:08.440
So this is tao...

06:08.440 --> 06:10.150
Impossible.

06:15.870 --> 06:19.100
Wow, so they can be killed.

06:19.100 --> 06:23.360
I can see your tao as you're 
on the brink of death.

06:26.350 --> 06:27.990
Get up, monster.

06:27.990 --> 06:31.470
I've got a lot of questions for you.

06:31.470 --> 06:34.240
First, where are the Tensen?

06:35.740 --> 06:39.220
I could be wrong, but it looks 
like the scars are growing.

06:39.670 --> 06:42.000
Huh? What is it?

06:43.770 --> 06:45.750
Hey, you seem out of it.

06:45.750 --> 06:47.150
Sorry.

06:47.150 --> 06:49.260
Help me tie him up.

06:49.550 --> 06:51.020
<i>Am I wrong?</i>

06:51.020 --> 06:56.270
<i>I'm glad my brother is alive, 
but is he all right?</i>

06:56.270 --> 06:58.060
<i>And these scars...</i>

06:58.060 --> 07:03.770
<i>They look less like lacerations 
and more like vines.</i>

07:05.980 --> 07:07.350
What do you think, miss?

07:07.350 --> 07:09.740
I'm pretty impressive with a sword, right?

07:09.740 --> 07:10.920
Strong.

07:10.920 --> 07:14.420
I should be able to master 
the use of tao quickly.

07:15.220 --> 07:15.870
Huh?

07:15.870 --> 07:19.040
Tao, strong, weak.

07:19.040 --> 07:21.370
Strong, strong, no.

07:22.320 --> 07:23.880
I don't get it.

07:24.250 --> 07:25.160
Like this?

07:25.160 --> 07:27.300
Strong, strong, no.

07:27.690 --> 07:28.740
How about this?

07:28.740 --> 07:30.300
Strong, strong.

07:30.300 --> 07:33.370
Tao. Strong, weak.

07:33.370 --> 07:35.680
It's like we're playing 
some kind of word game.

07:35.680 --> 07:38.340
So I can't brute force it.

07:41.060 --> 07:43.610
He's pretty strong for a small guy.

07:43.610 --> 07:45.330
Miss, how about that?

07:45.330 --> 07:48.320
Strong, strong. No, no.

07:48.320 --> 07:49.940
The Hollow and the Blade Dragon.

07:49.940 --> 07:52.480
They're so dependable, it makes me laugh.

07:52.480 --> 07:53.950
What are you doing?

07:54.470 --> 07:56.450
Analyzing the monsters.

07:56.450 --> 07:59.580
Each monster's internal 
structure is different.

07:59.580 --> 08:01.020
Though they look similar,

08:01.020 --> 08:03.690
this one's internal 
structure resembles a fish,

08:03.690 --> 08:05.580
and this one's resembles a human.

08:05.580 --> 08:06.700
In other words?

08:06.700 --> 08:09.290
Each one has different weak points.

08:09.290 --> 08:12.340
Speaking of biological mysteries...

08:13.550 --> 08:15.360
She's a mystery as well.

08:15.360 --> 08:17.720
Who exactly is she, anyway?

08:19.970 --> 08:21.080
<i>In that moment,</i>

08:21.080 --> 08:25.480
<i>it looked like she used a mysterious power 
to carve away the cliff so we could escape.</i>

08:25.480 --> 08:28.650
<i>An ordinary human couldn't do that.</i>

08:29.030 --> 08:30.860
<i>Not an ordinary human...</i>

08:34.920 --> 08:36.680
<i>I made her cry again.</i>

08:36.680 --> 08:38.740
<i>She's still just a child on the inside.</i>

08:38.740 --> 08:40.160
Hey, shinobi.

08:40.460 --> 08:42.640
Don't make the young lady cry.

08:42.640 --> 08:45.120
Girls won't like you 
if you keep glaring like that.

08:45.590 --> 08:48.550
That's fine with me. I'm married.

08:48.550 --> 08:49.670
What?

08:50.340 --> 08:52.200
That's not what I meant.

08:52.200 --> 08:55.840
You're my underling now. 
Don't make girls cry.

08:55.840 --> 08:57.850
I'm nobody's underling.

08:57.850 --> 09:01.850
<i>The Hollow is more human than they say.</i>

09:01.850 --> 09:04.820
Strong, strong, strong, no.

09:05.730 --> 09:07.730
Do you have a wife?

09:07.730 --> 09:08.980
That's...

09:08.980 --> 09:11.230
From coast to coast, I—

09:23.560 --> 09:26.870
I have been secretly searching 
for you, Mei-sama.

09:26.870 --> 09:28.880
Mei-sama?

09:28.880 --> 09:32.660
It's been centuries since Mei-sama 
was banished from the palace.

09:32.660 --> 09:37.190
She disappeared from Horai, 
and we were at a loss.

09:37.190 --> 09:40.140
We were forbidden from looking 
for her by Rien-sama.

09:40.140 --> 09:42.960
But as luck would have it, 
we've been reunited.

09:44.020 --> 09:46.300
I am overjoyed.

09:46.300 --> 09:48.620
Let us return together.

09:48.620 --> 09:51.700
We need your help.

09:52.490 --> 09:53.940
What's going on here?

09:54.370 --> 09:56.040
I could ask you the same thing.

09:56.040 --> 09:57.660
I don't know how it happened,

09:58.140 --> 10:02.500
but she does not belong with you humans.

10:02.800 --> 10:07.670
Like the Tensen, she feeds off of humans.

10:07.790 --> 10:09.720
Tensen? You mean those Tensen?

10:09.720 --> 10:11.420
She's one of them?

10:11.420 --> 10:13.920
<i>So she's not human after all.</i>

10:14.720 --> 10:18.680
Please return to Horai and lead us.

10:18.680 --> 10:21.800
Without your help, we...

10:21.800 --> 10:26.310
<i>If I get involved in any 
more trouble, I could lose my way.</i>

10:26.620 --> 10:28.530
<i>Lose sight of my true goal.</i>

10:28.530 --> 10:30.840
<i>The real reason I joined this expedition.</i>

10:30.840 --> 10:33.350
<i>What should I be doing right now?</i>

10:40.920 --> 10:43.360
What are you doing, human?

10:43.360 --> 10:44.950
Sorry, I couldn't help myself.

10:45.470 --> 10:48.330
If you're trying to help her, 
then you're making a mistake.

10:48.330 --> 10:50.540
This matter does not concern you.

10:50.540 --> 10:53.120
Yeah, I guess you're right.

10:53.820 --> 10:56.840
I don't know the circumstances, 
and I might be overreaching.

10:57.160 --> 11:00.440
Besides, it's not something I do. 
Plus, it's a hassle.

11:00.820 --> 11:03.850
Even I'm surprised I acted impulsively.

11:03.850 --> 11:07.980
But I can't make her cry again.

11:08.240 --> 11:10.300
That's good enough for me.

11:11.480 --> 11:13.640
What a nuisance.

11:13.640 --> 11:17.740
But either way, we came 
to turn you into tan.

11:18.260 --> 11:19.240
When did they get there?

11:22.320 --> 11:24.700
We're taking Mei-sama back with us.

11:24.700 --> 11:27.950
Is he the boss of those butterflies?

11:28.350 --> 11:30.420
I'm gonna kill him.

11:36.730 --> 11:40.340
<i>Judging by their appearance, 
they're insect-users.</i>

11:40.670 --> 11:42.610
<i>Or are they their boss?</i>

11:42.610 --> 11:44.470
<i>Approaching them carelessly 
would be dangerous.</i>

11:46.760 --> 11:50.270
I lost my left hand because of these things.

11:50.270 --> 11:52.480
I owe them a big thank you.

11:52.480 --> 11:54.930
Then you should thank me as well.

11:54.930 --> 11:58.270
I'm the one who modif—
healed your left hand.

11:58.270 --> 12:00.750
I'm not sure "thank you" is the right word.

12:01.120 --> 12:02.790
No, I'm serious.

12:02.790 --> 12:06.490
Everything is improved by loss.

12:06.830 --> 12:09.960
My skill with a blade 
has gotten even stronger!

12:12.120 --> 12:13.000
What was that?

12:13.320 --> 12:15.250
It's those invisible attacks.

12:15.250 --> 12:17.250
These things use them, too?

12:17.250 --> 12:18.600
Don't charge in recklessly.

12:18.600 --> 12:20.440
They use invisible abilities.

12:20.440 --> 12:23.160
I see. So this is tao.

12:23.160 --> 12:23.840
What?

12:26.720 --> 12:29.020
Damn pests, scurrying around.

12:32.890 --> 12:35.000
Stay out of my way, underling.

12:35.000 --> 12:36.270
I'm not your underling.

12:36.270 --> 12:37.560
You're getting in my way.

12:37.560 --> 12:40.440
I wanna kill those butterflies.

12:40.440 --> 12:43.670
You are no match for us.

12:43.670 --> 12:46.450
You're not even someone who should 
concern themselves with Mei-sama.

12:46.450 --> 12:48.420
So why do you protect her?

12:48.850 --> 12:49.950
<i>You're right.</i>

12:49.950 --> 12:53.210
<i>The old me might've abandoned her.</i>

12:53.500 --> 12:57.420
<i>Since we arrived, I haven't 
been acting like myself.</i>

12:57.420 --> 13:00.340
<i>But I don't feel bad about it.</i>

13:01.010 --> 13:05.340
Helping someone who helped you 
is common sense, right?

13:05.340 --> 13:09.410
Why are you so obsessed with the girl?

13:09.410 --> 13:11.850
She doesn't seem to like it.

13:12.120 --> 13:15.750
The doshi study tao and train in its use.

13:15.750 --> 13:19.770
Mei-sama is essential to that training.

13:19.770 --> 13:23.030
Train? But you're monsters.

13:23.030 --> 13:25.730
Tao exists within all things.

13:25.730 --> 13:27.840
Foolish and pathetic humans,

13:27.840 --> 13:30.280
I shall teach you before you become tan.

13:30.280 --> 13:33.230
There are five steps to mastering tao.

13:33.560 --> 13:37.750
Doin, taisoku, shuitsu, shuten...

13:37.750 --> 13:41.640
And finally, most important 
of all, bochu jutsu.

13:42.000 --> 13:44.970
Bochu jutsu requires a partner,

13:44.970 --> 13:48.050
as it involves the circulation of yin 
and yang, or congress.

13:48.890 --> 13:50.400
What does "congress" mean?

13:51.810 --> 13:54.070
In plain terms, he means sexual intercourse.

13:54.070 --> 13:55.060
What?

13:55.930 --> 13:58.730
Screwing for training? That's ridiculous.

13:58.730 --> 14:00.690
It is a noble type of training.

14:01.120 --> 14:05.220
All things possess either yin or yang qi.

14:05.220 --> 14:08.920
One must grow their tao 
to the point that both circulate.

14:09.540 --> 14:12.600
The mind and body are prepared through 
training such as doin and taisoku,

14:12.600 --> 14:16.020
and both parties' yin and yang are joined 
and made to circulate.

14:16.020 --> 14:18.330
This is bochu jutsu.

14:18.690 --> 14:24.610
Tao heightened in this way is said to possess 
the power to change the laws of nature.

14:25.090 --> 14:30.220
It was our masters, the Tensen, 
who developed this technique.

14:31.220 --> 14:33.820
The Tensen are transcendent 
beings who can circulate yin

14:33.820 --> 14:38.040
and yang on their own in addition 
to performing bochu jutsu.

14:38.040 --> 14:40.580
Through repeated circulations 
and conversions of yin and yang,

14:40.580 --> 14:42.610
they heighten their tao.

14:42.940 --> 14:45.610
They have trained 
for a thousand years in order

14:45.610 --> 14:48.460
to achieve the greatest 
level of tao possible.

14:49.160 --> 14:51.830
Yin and yang are expressed as the sexes.

14:51.830 --> 14:54.740
In the case of the Tensen, each one is both.

14:54.740 --> 14:57.290
<i>The circulation of yin and yang...</i>

14:57.320 --> 14:59.770
<i>That must be when they 
swap between male and female.</i>

15:00.750 --> 15:04.030
But ordinary creatures only 
possess one or the other.

15:04.030 --> 15:07.650
Therefore, they require a partner 
for yin-yang circulation.

15:07.650 --> 15:10.300
We are male. We possess yang qi.

15:10.300 --> 15:14.310
Mei-sama is yin, and her qi 
is of the highest quality.

15:14.310 --> 15:21.060
Joining and circulating Mei-sama's yin with 
our yang allows us to perform bochu jutsu.

15:21.060 --> 15:22.640
In other words...

15:22.640 --> 15:25.360
Don't say it. It makes me want to puke.

15:25.360 --> 15:28.890
Though Mei-sama and 
the Tensen share the same origins,

15:28.890 --> 15:31.490
she is an inferior being 
who possesses only yin qi.

15:31.490 --> 15:34.330
It's the reason she was 
banished from the palace.

15:34.730 --> 15:38.120
Rien-sama gave Mei-sama two choices.

15:38.120 --> 15:40.620
Die like a dog,

15:40.620 --> 15:44.320
or remain in Horai as our training partner.

15:44.640 --> 15:49.670
Rien-sama inflicted those scars 
on her body as a mark of that.

15:51.550 --> 15:55.960
However, Mei-sama disappeared from Horai.

15:55.960 --> 15:59.060
Please return so that we 
can conduct our training.

15:59.320 --> 16:02.040
I see now why she's afraid of you.

16:02.040 --> 16:04.310
You're totally disgusting.

16:05.310 --> 16:07.570
A human wouldn't understand.

16:07.570 --> 16:10.070
Ninja, I'm gonna kill that centi—

16:13.100 --> 16:15.400
Since we arrived, I haven't 
been acting like myself.

16:16.310 --> 16:17.560
No,

16:17.560 --> 16:20.600
I've been seeing sides of myself 
that not even I knew about.

16:20.600 --> 16:22.120
I'm a little surprised.

16:23.040 --> 16:25.830
Apparently I find that kind of 
behavior unforgivable.

16:29.240 --> 16:30.750
Marked?

16:31.120 --> 16:33.720
Don't talk about her like she's an object.

16:33.720 --> 16:34.760
I see.

16:35.510 --> 16:38.590
It will be difficult to turn you into tan.

16:42.060 --> 16:44.730
Senjutsu: False Kishikai.

16:44.730 --> 16:46.730
I'll kill you all here.

16:46.730 --> 16:48.230
I'd like to see you try.

16:48.230 --> 16:50.920
Hermit? More like a transformed monster.

16:52.120 --> 16:54.560
That Tensen transformed 
into a monster as well.

16:54.560 --> 16:56.120
Is this the same ability?

16:57.800 --> 17:00.240
We can't afford to lose this time.

17:04.120 --> 17:05.120
Whoops.

17:05.510 --> 17:08.000
Their attacks are easier 
to dodge now that they've merged.

17:09.640 --> 17:12.430
<i>I feel dizzy. Did I inhale 
the insects' scales?</i>

17:12.430 --> 17:14.630
<i>They're tough opponents.</i>

17:14.630 --> 17:16.010
Underling, assist me!

17:16.010 --> 17:16.840
I can't!

17:18.140 --> 17:19.260
It's hard.

17:19.260 --> 17:21.270
But it'll burn.

17:25.870 --> 17:27.900
Senjutsu: Tin Splinter.

17:29.400 --> 17:33.360
<i>They're not as strong as the Tensen, 
but I still can't see it.</i>

17:34.610 --> 17:36.940
Those butterflies 
are dangerous, Shortymaru.

17:37.700 --> 17:39.700
Ninpo: Pyro Bridge.

17:44.890 --> 17:46.210
Stop.

17:46.210 --> 17:48.710
You'll hit Mei-sama.

17:48.710 --> 17:51.380
<i>Tao, the invisible power.</i>

17:51.910 --> 17:53.670
<i>I can sense it vaguely,</i>

17:53.670 --> 17:56.590
<i>but I need to be able to detect it 
more precisely in order to fight.</i>

17:56.590 --> 17:59.260
<i>I don't have time to stumble 
over this opponent.</i>

17:59.580 --> 18:01.450
<i>My real opponents are them.</i>

18:01.450 --> 18:03.770
<i>If only I could understand 
what the girl said.</i>

18:03.770 --> 18:06.490
You're straining yourself 
too much, apparently.

18:07.020 --> 18:11.890
In order to see tao, your mind 
must be both strong and weak.

18:12.720 --> 18:14.030
How do you know that?

18:14.030 --> 18:19.270
It's essentially the same way Sugita Genpaku 
translated the <i>Tafel Anatomie</i>.

18:19.270 --> 18:22.790
I deciphered her words 
and had her demonstrate.

18:23.150 --> 18:28.670
I had her assist me in sensing my own 
tao by having her touch it directly.

18:29.400 --> 18:31.870
<i>I sense something, but that's all.</i>

18:31.870 --> 18:33.300
<i>I don't see anything.</i>

18:38.300 --> 18:43.400
Seeing tao requires training 
and a specific state of mind.

18:43.400 --> 18:48.060
Gabimaru, in your case, 
you need to weaken your mind.

18:48.640 --> 18:51.340
Weaken it? We're in the middle of battle.

18:51.340 --> 18:52.440
Regardless, you must.

18:52.880 --> 18:55.570
Tao is like a visible 
expression of life force.

18:55.870 --> 18:59.320
Without both strength 
and weakness, it can't be detected.

18:59.720 --> 19:02.450
<i>Weaken my mind?</i>

19:02.450 --> 19:04.720
Strong, fruit of weak.

19:05.160 --> 19:07.650
Weak, seed of strong.

19:08.840 --> 19:10.580
That's not weakness.

19:10.580 --> 19:12.080
It's the seed of strength.

19:12.080 --> 19:14.340
Strong and weak.

19:14.340 --> 19:16.840
All important.

19:18.850 --> 19:22.680
I doubt it can be learned overnight, though.

19:22.680 --> 19:26.180
No, I'm good. I mostly get it.

19:26.180 --> 19:27.020
What?

19:27.020 --> 19:29.930
Mostly? Wait a minute.

19:29.930 --> 19:30.880
Big.

19:30.880 --> 19:31.690
Huh?

19:32.920 --> 19:35.940
Gabimaru tao big.

19:37.840 --> 19:39.240
That feeling.

19:42.110 --> 19:44.520
Senjutsu: Tin Splinter...

19:45.370 --> 19:46.660
He's dodging them.

19:46.660 --> 19:48.510
He understood from just that explanation?

19:48.510 --> 19:51.120
He's an Iwagakure shinobi, isn't he?

19:51.560 --> 19:54.420
I've heard some of them 
use superhuman abilities.

19:54.800 --> 19:56.910
He may not know the term tao,

19:56.910 --> 19:59.800
but it wouldn't surprise me 
if he's mastered similar techniques.

20:00.200 --> 20:03.160
This is Gabimaru the Hollow's true nature.

20:03.160 --> 20:06.430
It's the result of training 
to the point of losing one's humanity.

20:15.320 --> 20:19.570
<i>I can predict the intention and direction 
of his attacks from the movement of his tao.</i>

20:19.840 --> 20:22.070
<i>I can clearly sense 
the monsters behind me, too.</i>

20:22.860 --> 20:26.490
<i>I trained endlessly at Iwagakure,</i>

20:26.490 --> 20:29.300
<i>but none of them taught me this feeling.</i>

20:29.640 --> 20:31.520
<i>It's not just strong presences.</i>

20:31.520 --> 20:34.750
<i>I sense weak ones as well, 
everything around me.</i>

20:35.560 --> 20:37.630
<i>By accepting my own weakness,</i>

20:37.630 --> 20:41.480
<i>I can finally sense the weakness in others.</i>

20:42.480 --> 20:46.760
<i>The space between a tough heart 
and a delicate one, or both.</i>

20:47.420 --> 20:50.240
<i>It's like I'm deep in the waves of conflict.</i>

20:51.880 --> 20:53.730
<i>I understand her strength now.</i>

20:53.730 --> 20:57.360
<i>The way she moves forward while wavering.</i>

20:59.880 --> 21:02.050
<i>Both stronger and weaker.</i>

21:02.050 --> 21:06.990
<i>I know the intention and direction of 
each and every insect on its arms.</i>

21:07.330 --> 21:10.200
<i>It's like knowing 
the large waves that are created</i>

21:10.200 --> 21:13.360
<i>when a single drop of water collides 
with its surroundings.</i>

21:17.240 --> 21:19.790
Ninjutsu? No...

21:20.600 --> 21:22.630
I can't believe a human 
is capable of such a feat.

21:22.910 --> 21:26.140
He's like... like the Tensen.

21:27.610 --> 21:29.390
You can't win now.

21:37.810 --> 21:40.980
Now I'm finally 
on the same level as the Tensen.

21:40.980 --> 21:44.940
He learned to detect tao 
in such a short amount of time?

21:44.940 --> 21:46.740
The precision of his technique is...

21:46.740 --> 21:48.180
Tell me.

21:48.180 --> 21:51.490
Do you have other allies? 
Where are the Tensen?

21:52.090 --> 21:54.940
This is the end for me. 
I shall answer your questions.

21:54.940 --> 22:00.500
Including me, three doshi were instructed 
by the Tensen to spy on the humans.

22:00.500 --> 22:03.760
They said there was something different 
about the ones who arrived this time.

22:04.050 --> 22:08.140
That if we didn't do something about them, 
they could become a threat to us.

22:08.140 --> 22:10.390
It would seem they were right.

22:11.590 --> 22:13.140
Hey, wait!

22:13.140 --> 22:15.810
I'm the star here. You're stealing
 my spotlight, underling.

22:15.810 --> 22:17.130
I'll deal the finishing blow.

22:17.130 --> 22:18.270
I'm not your underling.

22:25.620 --> 22:28.700
Ninpo: Stone Storm, Centipede Mode.

22:40.840 --> 22:44.350
So this is Horai...
